# Site crawl artifacts (rebuildable via scripts/crawl_site.py).
# data/base/ is the exception: hand-written base-layer identity digest,
# not rebuildable from a crawl — it must ship with the repo.
data/*
!data/base/
.gstack/
lux-service/.venv/
lux-service/LuxTTS/
lux-service/.verified
logs/
nohup.out
.loopback-voice.wav

# Lawyer-eval snapshots: regenerated by populate_fake_calendar.py (step 1)
# and fetch_availability.py (step 2). Dated calendar snapshots must not be
# committed — a frozen availability fixture is what made the scheduler book
# days in the past (2026-07-27).
scripts/lawyer_eval/availability.json
scripts/lawyer_eval/ground_truth.json
